{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>博雷頓配股集資逾2.2億元。</p><p></p><p>每股配售價12.06元，較上日收市價折讓逾百分之6，配售最多逾1,831萬股新股，佔已擴大發行本百分之4.3，集資所得主要用於投資及開發海外光儲項目。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-14T01:39:02.242400+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":90,"images":0,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-14T00:55:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:59.957000+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-14T01:31:59.957000+00:00","content_hash":"6571a501dc48d0734e0cd1504283890602df0cd69cda317074a50756361e7dfd","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}